---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import { getAge } from "@/utils/date";

const meta = {
	description: "About Damir Pavlik.",
	title: "About",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<h1 class="title mb-12">About Me</h1>
	<div class="prose prose-sm prose-cactus max-w-none">
		<p>
			I’m Damir Pavlik, a {getAge()} year old software engineer driven by the need to understand how things
			truly work.
		</p>
		<p>
			I started early, struggled early, and chose to continue. What began as curiosity became
			discipline. Over time, I’ve learned that real progress doesn’t come from chasing shortcuts,
			but from staying with a problem long enough for it to reveal itself.
		</p>
		<p>
			I’m drawn to building real systems and dev tools. There’s something honest about seeing how
			small decisions shape larger outcomes. It’s a reminder that complexity is often just
			simplicity, carefully stacked.
		</p>
		<p>
			I value clarity over shortcuts, and depth over speed. Real understanding takes time, and I’m
			willing to pay that cost. In a world that rewards speed, I prefer depth.
		</p>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
